    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180070/extras/fe6cfaa93286308041c5dc8c57bd0979.poster.avif?t=1755090450\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180070/extras/fe6cfaa93286308041c5dc8c57bd0979.webm?t=1755090450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don\u2019t Panic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunrise. Twilight of earth. The world is ending. Acrid auromas of sun-scorched streets fill the air. Blackened corpses gnarled into shapes of agony line streets. Peering outside is enough to scorch eyes from socket. The only refuge is in the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the night belongs to the Visitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180070/extras/7a904850b90f4335ac588b7fdd07bbe4.poster.avif?t=1755090450\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180070/extras/7a904850b90f4335ac588b7fdd07bbe4.webm?t=1755090450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let the Right Ones In</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A knock on the door. A solitary voice, begging for refuge. They look like us. Talk like us. Smell like us. Are they us? Look for the signs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180070/extras/3a7102b11907e8d229af638843beb44a.poster.avif?t=1755090450\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180070/extras/3a7102b11907e8d229af638843beb44a.webm?t=1755090450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Guests, Your Death</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isolation is not an option. The Visitors will overwhelm us. Let some in. Hear their stories. Some will help. Some will need help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are Visitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180070/extras/464192168c41f49554ecc21ffe1e3d8b.poster.avif?t=1755090450\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180070/extras/464192168c41f49554ecc21ffe1e3d8b.webm?t=1755090450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do What You Must</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Visitors kill. Kill them first. Interrogate the guests. Do what must be done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180070/extras/706c391019748f73408a30f2b02a079b.poster.avif?t=1755090450\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180070/extras/706c391019748f73408a30f2b02a079b.webm?t=1755090450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180070/extras/fe6cfaa93286308041c5dc8c57bd0979.poster.avif?t=1755090450\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180070/extras/fe6cfaa93286308041c5dc8c57bd0979.webm?t=1755090450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don\u2019t Panic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunrise. Twilight of earth. The world is ending. Acrid auromas of sun-scorched streets fill the air. Blackened corpses gnarled into shapes of agony line streets. Peering outside is enough to scorch eyes from socket. The only refuge is in the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the night belongs to the Visitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180070/extras/7a904850b90f4335ac588b7fdd07bbe4.poster.avif?t=1755090450\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180070/extras/7a904850b90f4335ac588b7fdd07bbe4.webm?t=1755090450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let the Right Ones In</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A knock on the door. A solitary voice, begging for refuge. They look like us. Talk like us. Smell like us. Are they us? Look for the signs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180070/extras/3a7102b11907e8d229af638843beb44a.poster.avif?t=1755090450\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180070/extras/3a7102b11907e8d229af638843beb44a.webm?t=1755090450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Guests, Your Death</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isolation is not an option. The Visitors will overwhelm us. Let some in. Hear their stories. Some will help. Some will need help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are Visitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180070/extras/464192168c41f49554ecc21ffe1e3d8b.poster.avif?t=1755090450\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180070/extras/464192168c41f49554ecc21ffe1e3d8b.webm?t=1755090450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do What You Must</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Visitors kill. Kill them first. Interrogate the guests. Do what must be done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180070/extras/706c391019748f73408a30f2b02a079b.poster.avif?t=1755090450\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180070/extras/706c391019748f73408a30f2b02a079b.webm?t=1755090450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
